    "Never send PikoBuy passwords, payment details or support records through this independent site.": "なお、この独立サイトを通じてPikoBuyのパスワード、支払い情報、またはサポート記録を決して送信しないでください。",
    "No independent guide should make that promise. PikoBuy's user and shipping agreements describe third-party logistics and risks that include customs action, damage, loss and delays. The beginner guide says tracking information should become available within three days after shipment, but that is not continuous movement or a fixed arrival guarantee. Use the official carrier and support channels for a parcel-specific issue.": "No independent guide should make that promise. PikoBuy's user and shipping agreements describe third-party logistics and risks that include customs action, damage, loss and delays. The beginner guide says tracking information should become available within three days after shipment, but that is not continuous movement or a fixed arrival guarantee. Use the official carrier and support channels for a parcel-specific issue.",
