    "Official user agreement": "ce(公式ユーザー契約)",
    "Once acceptable items are ready, review the international parcel as a new purchase decision. PikoBuy's estimator uses destination, product type, weight and dimensions because shipping is not determined by scale weight alone. Bulky light items may be billed using a volumetric calculation. Packaging removal may reduce volume, while reinforcement may add weight. The cheapest-looking route is not automatically suitable for every product.": "Once acceptable items are ready, review the international parcel as a new purchase decision. PikoBuy's estimator uses destination, product type, weight and dimensions because shipping is not determined by scale weight alone. Bulky light items may be billed using a volumetric calculation. Packaging removal may reduce volume, while reinforcement may add weight. The cheapest-looking route is not automatically suitable for every product.",
